  <String x:Key="Setup.Misc.System.StopUsingPclCe.Message" xmlns="clr-namespace:System;assembly=System.Private.CoreLib">This will delete all PCL Ray settings, cached data, saved account information, and other related data from this computer. Your acceptance of any license agreements will also be revoked. PCL Ray will close automatically when the process is complete.

