  <String x:Key="Setup.Misc.System.Telemetry.ToolTip" xmlns="clr-namespace:System;assembly=System.Private.CoreLib">When enabled, the launcher will collect and report errors and device environment information. This helps developers fix potential issues and better plan and develop the launcher.
